sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Dashboard UI
    participant Istio as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MR as model-registry-service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (Istio mTLS)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / MySQL<br/>5432 / 3306/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as IS Controller<br/>8081/TCP health
    participant BFF as BFF Proxy<br/>4000/TCP HTTP
    participant Job as async-upload Job<br/>(Python)
    participant S3 as S3 / HuggingFace / OCI<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,DB: Flow 1: Model Registration via REST API
    Client->>Istio: POST /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/*<br/>Auth: User JWT
    Istio->>MR: Forward request<br/>Istio mTLS + AuthorizationPolicy<br/>(namespace + principal)
    MR->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE model metadata<br/>GORM (configurable TLS)<br/>Auth: DB credentials (Secret)
    DB-->>MR: Query result
    MR-->>Istio: JSON response
    Istio-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over K8sAPI,MR: Flow 2: InferenceService Synchronization
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch InferenceService CRDs<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>MR: GET model metadata<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    MR-->>Controller: Model registry data
    Controller->>K8sAPI: PATCH InferenceService<br/>(labels + annotations)<br/>HTTPS / SA token

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Async Model Upload
    Client->>BFF: POST upload request<br/>4000/TCP HTTP<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview check<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP<br/>Auth: User token
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Authorized
    BFF->>K8sAPI: Create Job resource<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Job created
    BFF-->>Client: 202 Accepted (Job reference)
    Job->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP<br/>Auth: AWS IAM / Token
    S3-->>Job: Model data
    Job->>MR: Register model metadata<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    Job->>S3: Upload to destination<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP + sigstore signing
